      "width": 690,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### ⛓️ Asynchronous Micro-Chain DAG (<18ms Finality)\n- **Ed25519 Account Micro-Chains**: Every sovereign actor, ZothNet node, and Hermes agent owns an asynchronous `SEND` + `RECV` micro-chain.\n- **Zero Gas Fees (0.00 VLR / $0.00 Forever)**: Dual-block consensus eliminates mempool fee auctions.\n- **14.2ms (<18ms) Finality**: Instant frontier confirmation with strict balance conservation ($\\sum \\Delta B = 0$)."
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1310,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 1170,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### ⚡ 5-Validator Byzantine Fault Tolerant (BFT) Quorum & ZothNet PoR\n- **Quorum Equation**: Requires $\\ge 4/5$ (80%) Byzantine signatures for state finality across 5 regional anchors.\n- **+5.00 VLR Proof-of-Relay (PoR)**: Credited automatically to ZothNet v1.2.2 relay nodes (Linux VPS, Pixel 10 Pro, Moto G 2025, Moto G Stylus) for routing 1,280-byte Sphinx & GossipSub packets.\n- **ZML Native Settlement**: `PAY_LINK` and `LOCKED_PAY_LINK` directives settle atomically in `zoth://storefront`."
    },
    {
      "id": "b200000000000001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 50,
      "y": -800,
      "width": 1250,
      "height": 720,
      "label": "⛏️ PoUW Cognitive Mining & Neuro-Memory STDP Engrams (:8094)",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
