      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 🛡️ Pedersen Commitments & Anti-Phishing @Handle Guard\n- **Homomorphic Blinding**: $C = vG + rH$ with Bulletproof range proofs.\n- **Human-Readable Handles**: `@1nc0gn30`, `@zoth`, `@studio` with Hamming-distance typosquat defense."
