      "color": "2",
      "text": "### 🧰 13-Tool Vaelor MCP & 11-Tool ZothNet MCP\n- **CLI & RPC**: `vaelor-cli`, `zothnet ledger balance`, `zoth-second-brain vaelor [--mine] [--json]`\n- **100% Open-Access**: Optional Stripe Coffee + Solana tip rails."
